      "chunk_text": "Sneha Roy asked Vikram Patel to confirm if her auto insurance policy had expired. Vikram confirmed it had expired due to non\u2011payment and that a renewal quote had been emailed. Sneha said she hadn't received any notification, so Vikram resent the quote and explained the renewal steps\u2014click the email link, review terms, and pay online\u2014offering further assistance. Sneha thanked him and said she would review the quote and contact him if she needs help.",
